            <div xml:id="d208-a1">

                <pb facs="0389" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg319"/>

                <p rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 1]</p>
                <p>RESOLUTION passed by the senate of the Republic of Liberia on the visit of his
                    excellency John Seys, minister resident and consul general from the United
                    States of America to the Republic of Liberia.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved,</hi> That the senate of the Republic of Liberia
                    is greatly gratified and honored in receiving among them as minister resident
                    and consul general of the United States the old and tried friend of Liberia and
                    Africa, the Rev. John Seys.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAN. J. BEAMS, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Senate Republic
                            of Liberia.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Adopted by the senate <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1867-01-04">January 4,
                        1867</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
